{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And they called</b> — they all believed in the honored Name and returned to call upon Him." "<b>for the life</b> — meaning \"because of,\" as in: \"and Jacob served for Rachel\" (Genesis 29:20)." "<b>as you desired</b> — for it became clear to them that because of him the sea was storming."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:02.657137313Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}